Fixed-Rate Reset Notes. Unless otherwise provided in the applicable supplement, it is
expected that a fixed-rate reset note will qualify as a “variable rate debt instrument” that provides
for stated interest at a single qualified floating rate in addition to a single fixed rate. Assuming
